nt_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1322134013":{"text":"亡灵需要我们帮助？是什么事情？","source_cn":"亡灵需要我们帮助？是什么事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F1F7319745939A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1322134014:1":{"text":"这件事需要我们合作。如果成功了，活死人就不会再成为白山人民的威胁。","source_cn":"这件事需要我们合作。如果成功了，活死人就不会再成为白山...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D5A349CA8FCA3B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1322134015:1":{"text":"那些活死人，他们曾是第一次神魔战争时的士兵，是白山的英雄。我希望我们能够一起让他们在圣光中得到净化，回到女神的神国。","source_cn":"那些活死人，他们曾是第一次神魔战争时的士兵，是白山的英...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72CA457F330E845B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1322134016:1":{"text":"我承认我被你打动了。可你们很清楚，我们的力量太弱，根本没办法对付活死人……艾雅在上，愿祂保佑你们。","source_cn":"我承认我被你打动了。可你们很清楚，我们的力量太弱，根本...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C396BD2E2C82003","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1322134017:1":{"text":"我……我必须说实话，虽然很感激你们的救命之恩，但我目前还无法接受和亡灵合作这件事。很抱歉……我会祈求女神祝福你们的。","source_cn":"我……我必须说实话，虽然很感激你们的救命之恩，但我目前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164099615B51771A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","